      },
      "findings": [
        {
          "source_quote": "Κλήμεντος τῶν Πέτρου ἐπιδημίων κηρυγμάτων ἐπιτομή",
          "english_quote": "Clement’s Epitome of Peter’s Sojourn-Preachings.",
          "issue": "The compound preserves ἐπιδημίων as qualifying the preachings, and the preceding κατὰ πόλιν supports an association with Peter's visits or stays. It remains an interpretive rendering rather than an unambiguous equivalent: the adjective can also concern local presence or activity among a population. The source_issues note adequately preserves those alternatives. Acceptance of this provisional title does not resolve its precise lexical force.",
          "suggested_revision": "No replacement proposed. Retain the title's lexical explanation, alternative renderings, and existing publication hold. Any change to a temporal paraphrase or a local/public rendering requires a fresh comparison with the supplied adjective. Keep the discussion of ἐπιγράψαντα separate as a syntactic feature; the suggested nominative normalization is not an established source correction.",
          "severity": "minor"
        }
      ]
    }
